#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The following command resolves a hostname via B<systemd-"
"resolved.service>(8)\\*(Aqs B<ResolveHostname> method call\\&."
msgstr ""
"Der folgende Befehl löst einen Rechnernamen mittels des Methodenaufrufs "
"B<ResolveHostname> von B<systemd-resolved.service>(8) auf\\&."

#. type: Plain text
