"$ varlinkctl call /run/systemd/resolve/io\\&.systemd\\&.Resolve io\\&.systemd\\&.Resolve\\&.ResolveHostname \\*(Aq{\"name\":\"systemd\\&.io\",\"family\":2}\\*(Aq -j\n"
"{\n"
